          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поручать (poruchát) — \"to entrust, to put in charge of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ему часто поручают самые трудные задачи. Yemú chásto porucháyut sámyye trúdnyye zadáchi. He is often given the hardest tasks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective поручить (поручу, поручишь). Поручать кому что, or + infinitive."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поручать (poruchát) \"to commission, to entrust\" is built on ручать \"to vouch, to guarantee\", from рука \"hand\" (EtymDB). To entrust a task is to put it into someone’s hands."
            }
          ]
        },
